WEBVTT

00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:05.480
Even though I said we're going to the countryside, it's only for two days.

00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:10.190
We'll visit the family grave, go to the festival, and then come home.

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:12.540
A festival? That sounds lovely.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:14.860
I've heard it's a big event.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:19.090
Nah, it's really just a small local thing.

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:21.660
I'll bring you back some kind of souvenir.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.870
Oh, you don't have to do that.

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:28.000
Sumika! The train is about to leave!

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.630
Then, I'll call you back tonight.

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:35.000
Okay. Have a safe trip!

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:36.600
I'm off!

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:53.820
Well, it's a good thing it
happened before you arrived.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:56.780
Are Mom and Dad all right?

00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:01.540
Fortunately, they were out helping
to prepare for the festival.

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:05.170
You can see the extent of the damage yourselves.

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:08.440
I know it's all the way up in the mountains, but could you stay at the temple?

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:12.940
If you explain the situation to them,
I'm sure they'll let you stay the night.

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:16.540
So, how's high school?

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:19.200
I heard you're the head of the class.

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:24.050
You've always been a natural leader, Sumi-chan.

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:27.790
My kids really liked you.

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:34.650
Whenever you would play with them, Sayaka would always cling to you saying "Sumi-chan! Sumi-chan!"

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:38.760
Yesterday, she told me she
was excited to see you again.

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:40.580
Make sure you spend some time with her, all right?

00:01:41.710 --> 00:01:44.830
It would be of great help if you
would take her to the festival.

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:50.400
We need to take care of the house
after what happened.

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:56.610
Sumi-chan?

00:01:57.680 --> 00:01:59.020
Will you be wearing a yukata?

00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:01.470
Um, yeah.

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:04.830
I wonder if the one
from last year still fits, though.

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:06.950
Did you grow taller?

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:58.100
What on earth are they doing?

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:11.190
I'm sorry, Kazama.

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:25.270
I guess I'll go back inside.

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:16.480
One, two!

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:25.560
I wonder if she's busy.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.790
I need to get off this mountain
soon and call Kazama.

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:37.500
Sumika!

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:40.330
Oh, good morning, kids.

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:41.760
Good morning, Sumi-chan!
We're not kids!

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:44.340
You're way too tall, Sumika!

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:45.650
What was that?

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:50.260
Teru said he'll marry you once
he grows taller than you!

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:51.880
I did not!

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:54.760
I never said that! Never!

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:56.270
Do you have morning practice as well, Sayaka?

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:58.400
Yep! Look at this!

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:01.150
I was promoted a rank while you were gone!

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:06.660
That's great! As for myself, well,
I already quit karate.

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:09.550
You did? Why?

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:13.600
Well, I just...

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:15.160
Sumika.

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:19.910
As you can see, we're a little...

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:21.820
Is this temple really all right?

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:25.990
I'm sorry, but could you fill in for me this morning?

00:05:25.990 --> 00:05:26.470
Eh?

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:27.550
Yay!

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:30.340
Ah, but I...

00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:31.320
Let's go, Sumika!

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:35.150
Don't worry. It shouldn't matter that you've had a little time off.

00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:37.580
I've improved a lot!

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:39.040
Hurry, hurry!

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:45.460
Everyone! Today, Murasame-san's daughter Sumika will be instructing us!
Hey, hold it! Wait a minute!

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:57.580
Good morning, Ushio-chan.

00:05:57.800 --> 00:06:00.510
Oh, good morning.

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:37.640
Hey, that's dangerous!

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:45.130
Teru is trying to show off in front of you, Sumi-chan.

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:53.790
Is this really all right, though? I should be helping them out with the house.

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:56.390
Well, my mother...

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:03.660
It's fine! I'll make sure these fools work hard!

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:05.390
...said that.

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:08.760
I guess it's fine, then.

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:17.070
Say, Sumi-chan...

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:21.800
You didn't bring a swimsuit?

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:27.920
Oh, since it was just a short trip this year,
I didn't think I'd have time to go swimming.

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:29.530
I see.

00:07:35.340 --> 00:07:38.850
Still, that sure is a revealing swimsuit.

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:41.190
I-Is it weird?

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:50.190
No! Well, rather than weird, it doesn't seem like something you'd wear by a river.

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:53.140
So it is weird?! Am I weird?!

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:56.250
I saw it in a magazine and thought it was cute.

00:07:56.260 --> 00:08:00.770
Since you're in high school now, I was certain that you'd have a cute one too.

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:02.890
And so... because...

00:08:03.240 --> 00:08:06.910
W-Woah! It's really cute!

00:08:11.730 --> 00:08:13.920
You don't need to force yourself.

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:17.660
I-I'm sorry.

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:40.490
You keep looking at your cell phone.

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:44.000
Are you expecting a call from someone?

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:49.160
No... Well, it's hard to explain.

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:55.920
Is it... um...

00:08:57.190 --> 00:08:58.380
...someone you like?

00:08:58.380 --> 00:08:59.390
Sumika!

00:08:59.690 --> 00:09:02.770
Look! I'm going to jump from here!

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:04.020
Fool!

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:06.060
That's dangerous! Cut it out!

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:08.290
Whatever, just watch me!

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:09.520
This is nothing—

00:09:11.890 --> 00:09:13.780
Teru!

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:29.740
Here you go.

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:31.300
Oh, thanks.

00:09:33.020 --> 00:09:36.460
Say, was there any news of an accident?

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:39.430
No, nothing special.

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:46.190
Still no word from Sumika-chan?

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:50.380
Even though she said she would call...

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:57.200
Why don't you call her?

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:09.460
No! Sumi-chan said she would call me!

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:17.650
A shift in the balance of power?

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:32.560
I'm sure she's just having fun
with her relatives right now.

00:10:33.720 --> 00:10:35.940
She'll be back tomorrow.

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:37.940
Let her enjoy herself.

00:10:41.510 --> 00:10:44.370
That makes it sound like I'm in her way!

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:51.880
Where are you going?

00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:58.350
The library!

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:07.600
It's almost like...

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:12.510
...she's waiting for a call from her lover.

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:42.430
Eh?! Really?

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:45.800
The soybean flavored natto is really good!

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:48.430
It doesn't smell like it.

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:42.730
The number you have dialed is either out of the service area, or the phone has been switched off.

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:57.330
Um...

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:00.250
Sumi-chan?

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:03.690
Uncle! Let me borrow your phone!

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:06.260
S-Sure...

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:21.400
I don't recognize this number.

00:13:22.590 --> 00:13:24.730
In that case, I'll call her home number!

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:26.160
H-Hey, are you a stalker?

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:32.320
I can't remember the number!

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:37.530
All because I've always relied on my cell phone...

00:13:38.220 --> 00:13:41.340
Um... Sumi-chan?

00:13:43.570 --> 00:13:48.450
For the next ten years,
I curse you not to grow an inch!

00:13:54.170 --> 00:13:55.930
I'm sorry, Sumika!

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:58.420
I'll definitely replace it for you!

00:13:58.420 --> 00:14:02.250
Even though I don't have any money, I'll definitely get it by New Year's!

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:09.120
Don't worry about it.

00:14:11.930 --> 00:14:14.100
It was the cheapest one anyway.

00:14:15.570 --> 00:14:18.420
Hey! We're leaving!

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.220
Okay!

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:23.920
Come on, we're going to the cemetery.

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:25.210
Get ready.

00:14:31.420 --> 00:14:33.690
I'm really sorry, Sumi-chan.

00:14:33.690 --> 00:14:35.700
Who were you calling?

00:14:36.760 --> 00:14:40.180
Oh, it was nothing important.

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:45.050
Just a friend, to let her know we've arrived safely.

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:46.760
That's all.

00:14:48.230 --> 00:14:49.860
What happened?

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:13.390
Sorry!

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:14.780
You're late!

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:16.650
I forgot my wallet.

00:15:16.650 --> 00:15:17.770
Again?

00:15:18.210 --> 00:15:20.560
I left it in my clothes from yesterday.

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:23.130
Why don't we try the extra large today?

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:26.800
For real? They'll complain that I'm eating too much!

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:39.790
I wonder if Kazama is worried.

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:44.570
Perhaps she's doing just fine.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:47.830
Perhaps she's just busy finishing up her homework.

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:55.800
Come to think of it, the new issue of that fashion magazine comes out today.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:16:02.180
She's probably excited, looking at pictures of Akemi-chan again.

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:17.580
There's just one thing I need to tell her.

00:16:19.280 --> 00:16:23.710
Yet that one thing... I can't bring myself to tell her.

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:40.610
I want to talk to her.

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:49.650
I want to hear her voice.

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:56.310
We will be closing shortly.

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:45.910
Saya-chan, isn't Teru-chan coming?

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:47.420
Teru's at home.

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:49.950
He's being punished for what
happened this afternoon.

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:51.000
Punished?

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:57.430
You see, he fell from a tree when we were playing by the river earlier.

00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:10.520
Sumi-chan, buy me a candied apple!

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:13.410
No! You can't just spend all your time eating.

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:15.570
Right, Sumi-chan?

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:20.860
Yeah...

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:17.600
Teruaki! Where are you going?

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:21.010
Hey!

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:45.210
Sumi-chan?

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:41.850
Sumika!

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:54.490
Excuse me for a moment!

00:20:59.620 --> 00:21:02.140
Ah, K-Kazama!

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:05.550
I'm so sorry!

00:21:05.550 --> 00:21:08.240
A lot happened last night.

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:10.090
And so...

00:21:13.840 --> 00:21:14.950
Kazama?

00:21:15.820 --> 00:21:17.390
Hello?

00:21:17.390 --> 00:21:20.530
Can you hear my voice?

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:29.150
I can hear you clearly.

00:23:06.210 --> 00:23:08.800
Let me know if there's something you don't understand when you're done.

00:23:09.170 --> 00:23:11.070
Okay. Thanks.

00:23:20.060 --> 00:23:22.250
What is it? Do you have a question?

00:23:31.530 --> 00:23:33.210
It's nothing!
